  "title": "ZBEE SEC: Enable empty payload security check",
  "description": "During r23 certification tests execution it is required to identify and check the **link key** which was used to encrypt (sign) **APS ACK**.\nSince **APS ACKs** do not contain payload, `zbee.sec.key` wasn't displayed along with **APS security header**.\nSolution is to continue logic of `dissect_zbee_secure` regardless of payload length.",
